WEBVTT

00:01:55.417 --> 00:02:00.851
Many people wonder why the people
of Belarus are speaking up now.

00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:04.476
What makes them keep taking to the streets

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.518
despite unprecedented police violence,

00:02:07.542 --> 00:02:09.708
despite state lawlessness?

00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:13.143
The answer I hear the most

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:15.958
is that people have become fearless,

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:20.375
and it's something
we have become together.

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:26.101
Because fear is the province of one.

00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:28.643
It feeds on isolation.

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.434
It doesn't discriminate: